meone with a sprain or strain, including spotting symptoms like pain, bruising and swelling around a joint and advice on how to treat.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"19\",{\"name\":\"twitter:image\",\"content\":\"https://assets.redcross.org.uk/82b1e254-5524-0172-0612-9ce813c7824c/8c37326f-49b7-4cbe-ab3e-116326be4fea/british-red-cross-logo-1200x630.jpg\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"20\",{\"rel\":\"shortcut icon\",\"href\":\"https://assets.redcross.org.uk/82b1e254-5524-0172-0612-9ce813c7824c/0a78d3e1-55f7-4f50-8e88-540594b4c38d/british-red-cross-logo-favicon-32x32.png\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"21\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"https://assets.redcross.org.uk/82b1e254-5524-0172-0612-9ce813c7824c/831c57af-40b5-43d1-8eeb-2b1ec64a0753/british-red-cross-logo-favicon-96x96.png\",\"sizes\":\"96x96\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"22\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"https://assets.redcross.org.uk/82b1e254-5524-0172-0612-9ce813c7824c/0a78d3e1-55f7-4f50-8e88-540594b4c38d/british-red-cross-logo-favicon-32x32.png\",\"sizes\":\"32x32\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"23\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"https://assets.redcross.org.uk/82b1e254-5524-0172-0612-9ce813c7824c/e763e2f2-11ea-4272-938d-aac611a027a4/british-red-cross-logo-favicon-16x16.png\",\"sizes\":\"16x16\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"24\",{\"rel\":\"apple-touch-icon\",\"href\":\"https://assets.redcross.org.uk/82b1e254-5524-0172-0612-9ce813c7824c/beb296a1-f376-4807-932b-be0f1e7d2dad/british-red-cross-logo-favicon.png\",\"sizes\":\"180x180\"}],[\"$\",\"$L47\",\"25\",{}]]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"48:I[222999,[\"$2\",\"$8\",\"$9\",\"$a\",\"$24\",\"$c\",\"$25\",\"$11\",\"$10\",\"$e\",\"$d\"],\"Video\"]\n49:I[739418,[\"$2\",\"$8\",\"$9\",\"$a\",\"$24\",\"$c\",\"$25\",\"$11\",\"$10\",\"$e\",\"$d\"],\"Accordion\"]\n4a:I[942759,[\"$2\",\"$8\",\"$9\",\"$a\",\"$24\",\"$c\",\"$25\",\"$11\",\"$10\",\"$e\",\"$d\"],\"CardContainer\"]\n3e:[\"$\",\"div\",\"b7a223de-34c7-4a3f-b470-d63044fe1587\",{\"className\":\"brc-richtext-container max-content mx-auto grid grid-cols-12 gap-4 mb-8 md:mb-12\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"brc-richtext max-w-full col-span-12 col-start-1 md:col-span-10 lg:col-span-8 lg:px-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",\"0\",{\"id\":\"what-is-a-strain-or-sprain\",\"children\":\"What is a strain or sprain?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"If someone has pain, swelling or bruising around a joint or muscle after a sudden movement to part of their body, they may have a sprain or strain.\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"2\",{\"id\":\"signs-and-symptoms-of-a-sprain-or-strain\",\"children\":\"Signs and symptoms of a sprain or strain\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"3\",{\"children\":\"Strains and sprains happen when someone suddenly moves part of their body. Around a joint or muscle they may have:\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",\"4\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"pain\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"swelling\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"bruising\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"children\":\"if the injury is at a joint, the person may have difficulty in moving a limb\"}]]}]]}]}]\n3f:[\"$\",\"div\",\"c143c854-b5c1-4cb0-9f55-d92194c9b9ee\",{\"className\":\"brc-richtext-container max-content mx-auto grid grid-cols-12 gap-4 mb-8 md:mb-12\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"brc-richtext max-w-full col-span-12 col-start-1 md:col-span-10 lg:col-span-8 lg:px-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",\"0\",{\"id\":\"first-aid-steps-for-someone-with-a-strain-or-sprain\",\"children\":\"First aid steps for someone with a strain or sprain\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",\"1\",{\"id\":\"1-get-the-person-to-rest\",\"children\":\"1. Get the person to rest.\"}]]}]}]\n40:[\"$\",\"div\",\"21203fe7-bd15-4bf8-9da2-df7daa2df6b0\",{\"className\":\"brc-richtext-container max-content mx-auto grid grid-cols-12 gap-4 mb-8 md:mb-12\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"brc-richtext max-w-full col-span-12 col-start-1 md:col-span-10 lg:col-span-8 lg:px-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",\"0\",{\"id\":\"2-apply-an-ice-pack-to-the-injury\",\"children\":\"2. Apply an ice pack to the injury.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"An ice pack could be ice or frozen vegetables wrapped in a tea towel. Applying it to the injury will reduce the swelling and pain.\"}]]}]}]\n41:[\"$\",\"div\",\"6d327fb7-84fa-47dc-8dac-6b08b3b54d0b\",{\"className\":\"brc-richtext-container max-content mx-auto grid grid-cols-12 gap-4 mb-8 md:mb-12\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"brc-richtext max-w-full col-span-12 col-start-1 md:col-span-10 lg:col-span-8 lg:px-0\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"3-if-there-is-no-improvement-seek-medical-advice\",\"children\":\"3. If there is no improvement, seek medical advice.\"}]}]}]\n42:[\"$\",\"div\",\"e552969d-2ebe-486c-9c50-b00b227a9294\",{\"className\":\"brc-richtext-container max-content mx-auto grid grid-cols-12 gap-4 mb-8 md:mb-12\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"brc-richtext max-w-full col-span-12 col-start-1 md:col-span-10 lg:col-span-8 lg:px-0\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"watch-how-to-help-someone-who-has-a-sprain-or-strain-1-minute-56-seconds\",\"children\":\"Watch how to help someone who has a sprain or strain (1 minute 56 seconds)\"}]}]}]\n43:[\"$\",\"$L48\",\"dd197736-1607-4aed-a897-3b7c059494c0\",{\"youtubeId\":\"3CEiFmVzzyc\",\"caption\":\"\",\"credit\":\"\",\"transcript\":\"$undefined\",\"transcriptLabel\":\"\",\"lang\":\"en\"}]\n44:[\"$\",\"$L49\",\"7c927715-bf37-4c1d-a1f2-d2498d9f0268\",{\"lang\":\"en\",\"title\":\"Common questions about first aid someone who has a strain or sprain\",\"sections\":[{\"sectionTitle\":\"What’s the difference between a strain and a sprain?\",\"sectionContent\":\"\u003cp\u003eA strain is when a muscle is damaged. A sprain is when a joint – such as a knee, ankle or wrist – is damaged.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"lang\":\"en\"},{\"sectionTitle\":\"Is there anything other than ice that I can use to help with a sprain or strain?\",\"sectionContent\":\"\u003cp\u003eYou can use something cold, such as frozen vegetables wrapped in a tea towel.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"lang\":\"en\"},{\"sectionTitle\":\"How long should I apply an ice pack to the injury for?\",\"sectionContent\":\"\u003cp\u003eApply the ice pack to the injury for no more than 10 minutes. Anything over 10 minutes can cause further damage.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"lang\":\"en\"},{\"sectionTitle\":\"What do I do after I have put an ice pack on the injury?\",\"sectionContent\":\"\u003cp\u003eKeep the injured part of the body supported in a raised position. Then apply a bandage around the injury. The bandage should not be tightly wrapped and you should make sure the bandage does not become tight.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"lang\":\"en\"},{\"sectionTitle\":\"Is the acronym RICE still used for helping someone with a strain or sprain?\",\"sectionContent\":\"\u003cp\u003eYes, RICE is a great way to remember how to help someone with a strain or sprain. The letters in RICE stand for:\u003c/p\u003e\\n\u003cul\u003e\\n  \u003cli\u003eRest\u003c/li\u003e\\n  \u003cli\u003eIce\u003c/li\u003e\\n  \u003cli\u003eComfortable support\u003c/li\u003e\\n  \u003cli\u003eElevate.\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003c/ul\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003eComfortable support can include an elasticated bandage around the affected joint or limb.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"lang\":\"en\"},{\"sectionTitle\":\"Can you use a warm cloth or alternate between warm and cold treatment?\",\"sectionContent\":\"\u003cp\u003eWarm treatments are not recommended first aid. An ice pack is the most effective way of reducing the swelling.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"lang\":\"en\"},{\"sectionTitle\":\"Should I call 999 for a strain or sprain?\",\"sectionContent\":\"\u003cp\u003eMost strains and sprains will feel better after rest and cooling.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003eSeek medical advice\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.redcross.org.uk/first-aid/learn-first-aid/broken-bone\\\"\u003eif you suspect that the bone is broken\u003c/a\u003e, there are other injuries, or the injury does not improve.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"lang\":\"en\"}]}]\n45:[\"$\",\"div\",\"4a91b99d-af89-4788-a727-03df5baac60b\",{\"className\":\"brc-richtext-container max-content mx-auto grid grid-cols-12 gap-4 mb-8 md:mb-12\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"brc-richtext max-w-full col-span-12 col-start-1 md:col-span-10 lg:col-span-8 lg:px-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"children\":[\"For more information on how to help someone (or yourself) with a strain or sprain, visit the \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"https://www.nhs.uk/conditions/sprains-and-strains/\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"data-analytics-id\":\"link\",\"children\":\"NHS website.\"}],\" During life-threatening emergencies, call 999, or for non-emergency medical help, call 111.\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"1\",{\"children\":[\"Have our First Aid app? Open it to try the quiz and test your knowledge. If you don't have it, \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"https://www.redcross.org.uk/first-aid/first-aid-apps\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"data-analytics-id\":\"link\",\"children\":\"download the app and start learning\"}],\".\"]}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"2\",{\"id\":\"more-first-aid-skills\",\"children\":\"More first aid skills:\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"3\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.redcross.org.uk/first-aid/learn-first-aid/bleeding-heavily\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"data-analytics-id\":\"link\",\"children\":\"Bleeding heavily first aid\"}]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"4\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.redcross.org.uk/first-aid/learn-first-aid/asthma-attack\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"data-analytics-id\":\"link\",\"children\":\"Asthma attack first aid\"}]}]]}]}]\n46:[\"$\",\"$L4a\",\"1b472aab-4997-4b7c-b13a-a21d434074b8\",{\"cardContainerItem\":{\"elements\":{\"title\":{\"name\":\"Title\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"You might also want to:\"},\"text\":{\"name\":\"Text\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"\"},\"cards\":{\"name\":\"Cards\",\"type\":\"modular_content\",\"value\":[\"first_aid_apps_card\",\"book_an_accredited_first_aid_course_card\"],\"linkedItems\":[{\"elements\":{\"title\":{\"name\":\"Title\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Try the First aid apps\"},\"text\":{\"name\":\"Text\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Simple first aid skills are only two taps away. Our British Red Cross first aid apps allows you quickly access up-to-date information of help someone in a first aid emergency. Available for adults, and children and babies.\"},\"link\":{\"name\":\"Link\",\"type\":\"modular_content\",\"value\":[\"download_first_aid_app\"],\"linkedItems\":[{\"elements\":{\"display\":{\"name\":\"Display\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Download first aid app\"},\"external_link\":{\"name\":\"External Link\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"\"},\"internal_link\":{\"name\":\"Internal Link\",\"type\":\"modular_content\",\"value\":[\"first_aid_apps\"],\"linkedItems\":[{\"elements\":{\"hero\":{\"name\":\"Hero\",\"type\":\"modular_content\",\"value\":[\"download_free_first_aid_apps_page_hero\"],\"linkedItems\":[{\"elements\":{\"title\":{\"name\":\"Title\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Download free first aid apps\"},\"text\":{\"name\":\"Text\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Learn first aid fast and stay prepared for emergencies wherever you are. Download our free first aid app today for guidance and training.\"},\"image\":{\"name\":\"Image\",\"type\":\"asset\",\"value\":[{\"name\":\"First-aid-app.png\",\"description\":\"Close-up shot of a man's hand holding an iPhone with the British Red Cross First Aid App open on the screen.\",\"type\":\"image/png\",\"size\":203255,\"url\":\"https://assets.redcross.org.uk/82b1e254-5524-0172-0612-9ce813c7824c/f464e93c-b7b5-4864-8a82-7daadf28cc44/First-aid-app.png?w=735\u0026h=413\u0026fit=clip\u0026rect=0,0,1084,610\",\"width\":1084,\"height\":610,\"renditions\":{\"default\":{\"rendition_id\":\"d94168fd-8f9b-49f0-86fa-f23693399600\",\"preset_id\":\"a6d98cd5-8b2c-4e50-99c9-15192bce2490\",\"width\":735,\"height\":413,\"query\":\"w=735\u0026h=413\u0026fit=clip\u0026rect=0,0,1084,610\",\"url\":\"https://assets.redcross.org.uk/82b1e254-5524-0172-0612-9ce813c7824c/f464e93c-b7b5-4864-8a82-7daadf28cc44/First-aid-app.png?w=735\u0026h=413\u0026fit=clip\u0026rect=0,0,1084,610\"}}}]},\"link\":{\"name\":\"Link\",\"type\":\"modular_content\",\"value\":[],\"linkedItems\":[]},\"background\":{\"name\":\"Background\",\"type\":\"multiple_choice\",\"value\":[{\"name\":\"White\",\"codename\":\"white\"}]}},\"system\":{\"codename\":\"download_free_first_aid_apps_page_hero\",\"collection\":\"main\",\"id\":\"a8c291ce-616c-468d-ba89-1fe4285e6703\",\"language\":\"en\",\"lastModified\":\"2025-10-14T10:09:24.2820025Z\",\"name\":\"Download free first aid apps-Page hero\",\"sitemapLocations\":[],\"type\":\"hero_page\",\"workflowStep\":\"published\",\"workflow\":\"default\"}}]},\"content\":{\"name\":\"Content\",\"type\":\"modular_content\",\"value\":[\"download_free_first_aid_apps_multi_col_layout_1\",\"free_first_aid_apps_multi_col_layout_2\",\"baby_and_child_first_aid_app_multi_col_layout_3\",\"gemma_s_story_card_container\",\"free_first_aid_apps_card_container_2\"],\"linkedItems\":[{\"elements\":{\"column_1\":{\"name\":\"Column 1\",\"type\":\"modular_content\",\"value\":[\"jump_to__rich_text\"],\"linkedItems\":[{\"elements\":{\"text\":{\"images\":[],\"linkedItemCodenames\":[],\"linkedItems\":[],\"links\":[],\"name\":\"Text\",\"type\":\"rich_text\",\"value\":\"\u003ch2\u003eJump to:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/h2\u003e\\n\u003cul\u003e\\n  \u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"#general-first-aid-app\\\"\u003eGeneral first aid app\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\\n  \u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"#baby-and-child-first-aid-app\\\"\u003eBaby and child first aid app\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003c/ul\u003e\"}},\"system\":{\"codename\":\"jump_to__rich_text\",\"collection\":\"main\",\"id\":\"3c7658a8-207a-4944-a073-4bc568c145e0\",\"language\":\"en\",\"lastModified\":\"2025-12-03T10:43:32.8550918Z\",\"name\":\"Jump to:-rich text\",\"sitemapLocations\":[],\"type\":\"rich_text\",\"workflowStep\":\"published\",\"workflow\":\"default\"}}]},\"column_2\":{\"name\":\"Column 2\",\"type\":\"modular_content\",\"value\":[\"download_free_first_aid_apps_rich_text_1_of_mcl\"],\"linkedItems\":[{\"elements\":{\"text\":{\"images\":[],\"linkedItemCodenames\":[],\"linkedItems\":[],\"links\":[],\"name\":\"Text\",\"type\":\"rich_text\",\"value\":\"\u003cp\u003eThe British Red Cross First Aid training apps equip you with simple first aid skills to use during emergencies.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003eOur first aid apps are available for free to download on Android and Apple mobile devices. They provide life-saving advice on first aid scenarios, such as choking,\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.redcross.org.uk/first-aid/learn-first-aid/heart-attack\\\"\u003eheart attack\u003c/a\u003e, seizures, and burns. We have a general first aid app as well as a first aid app specifically for baby and child first aid.\u003c/p\u003e\"}},\"system\":{\"codename\":\"download_free_first_aid_apps_rich_text_1_of_mcl\",\"collection\":\"main\",\"id\":\"b5d68eb9-c96b-4ab5-9cd8-a3d5a8a937c3\",\"language\":\"en\",\"lastModified\":\"2025-10-16T13:59:24.3492021Z\",\"name\":\"Download free first aid apps-rich text 1 of MCL\",\"sitemapLocations\":[],\"type\":\"rich_text\",\"workflowStep\":\"published\",\"workflow\":\"default\"}}]},\"show_bottom_border\":{\"name\":\"Show bottom border\",\"type\":\"multiple_choice\",\"value\":[{\"name\":\"Yes\",\"codename\":\"true\"}]}},\"system\":{\"codename\":\"download_free_first_aid_apps_multi_col_layout_1\",\"collection\":\"main\",\"id\":\"0cefa9ab-19f3-42d2-92c7-84db57e9e7cb\",\"language\":\"en\",\"lastModified\":\"2025-10-14T10:14:08.0765825Z\",\"name\":\"Download free first aid apps-multi col layout 1\",\"sitemapLocations\":[],\"type\":\"_multi_column_layout\",\"workflowStep\":\"published\",\"workflow\":\"default\"}},{\"elements\":{\"column_1\":{\"name\":\"Column 1\",\"type\":\"modular_content\",\"value\":[\"general_first_aid_app_app_links_rich_text\",\"baby_and_child_first_aid_app_quote\"],\"linkedItems\":[{\"elements\":{\"text\":{\"images\":[],\"linkedItemCodenames\":[],\"linkedItems\":[],\"links\":[],\"name\":\"Text\",\"type\":\"rich_text\",\"value\":\"\u003ch2\u003eGeneral first aid app\u003c/h2\u003e\\n\u003cul\u003e\\n  \u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/first-aid-by-british-red-cross/id483408666?itsct=apps_box_badge\u0026amp;itscg=30200\\\"\u003eDownload the app from the Apple App Store\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\\n  \u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://play.google.com/store/search?q=first+aid+by+british+red+cross\u0026amp;c=apps\u0026amp;hl=en_GB\u0026amp;pcampaignid=pcampaignidMKT-Other-global-all-co-prtnr-py-PartBadge-Mar2515-1\\\"\u003eDownload the app from Google Play for Android\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003c/ul\u003e\"}},\"system\":{\"codename\":\"general_first_aid_app_app_links_rich_text\",\"collection\":\"main\",\"id\":\"ee73ab68-3c59-4bb5-bc32-ab556b800451\",\"language\":\"en\",\"lastModified\":\"2025-10-16T13:59:31.7126642Z\",\"name\":\"General first aid app-app links-rich text\",\"sitemapLocations\":[],\"type\":\"rich_text\",\"workflowStep\":\"published\",\"workflow\":\"default\"}},{\"elements\":{\"quote\":{\"images\":[],\"linkedItemCodenames\":[],\"linkedItems\":[],\"links\":[],\"name\":\"Quote\",\"type\":\"rich_text\",\"value\":\"\u003cp\u003eGreat reassurance if you have a baby or child. I like that you can test your knowledge. Good to top up on your knowledge every now and then.\u003c/p\u003e\"},\"attribution\":{\"name\":\"Attribution\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"User review from Leila\"}},\"system\":{\"codename\":\"baby_and_child_first_aid_app_quote\",\"collection\":\"main\",\"id\":\"54dcb9bc-8614-4adf-819c-bc0bb97a5068\",\"language\":\"en\",\"lastModified\":\"2025-10-16T14:21:32.4223055Z\",\"name\":\"General first aid app-Quote\",\"sitemapLocations\":[],\"type\":\"quote\",\"workflowStep\":\"published\",\"workflow\":\"default\"}}]},\"column_2\":{\"name\":\"Column 2\",\"type\":\"modular_content\",\"value\":[\"general_first_aid_app_rich_text_2\",\"general_first_aid_app_image\"],\"linkedItems\":[{\"elements\":{\"text\":{\"images\":[],\"linkedItemCodenames\":[],\"linkedItems\":[],\"links\":[],\"name\":\"Text\",\"type\":\"rich_text\",\"value\":\"\u003cp\u003eThe British Red Cross free general first aid app covers over 20 first aid skills. Using a simple and easy-to-learn approach, the app is suitable for anyone looking to learn first aid to help others in an emergency.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\u003ch2\u003eKey app features:\u003c/h2\u003e\\n\u003cul\u003e\\n  \u003cli\u003esimple step-by-step guides\u0026nbsp;\u003c/li\u003e\\n  \u003cli\u003evideos and interactive quizzes\u003c/li\u003e\\n  \u003cli\u003eworks without internet\u003c/li\u003e\\n  \u003cli\u003euseful tips and signposting to further information\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003c/ul\u003e\"}},\"system\":{\"codename\":\"general_first_aid_app_rich_text_2\",\"collection\":\"main\",\"id\":\"adc471cc-cda6-45da-82ad-a9415c298fd6\",\"language\":\"en\",\"lastModified\":\"2025-10-14T10:38:38.7983669Z\",\"name\":\"General first aid app-rich text 2\",\"sitemapLocations\":[],\"type\":\"rich_text\",\"workflowStep\":\"published\",\"workflow\":\"default\"}},{\"elements\":{\"source\":{\"name\":\"Source\",\"type\":\"asset\",\"value\":[{\"name\":\"British-Red-Cross-first-aid-app-being-tested-on-a-mobile-phone.jpg\",\"description\":\"Close up of hands holding a mobile phone showing the British Red Cross first aid app, as left hand scrolls through a test quiz.\",\"type\":\"image/jpeg\",\"size\":50098,\"url\":\"https://assets.redcross.org.uk/82b1e254-5524-0172-0612-9ce813c7824c/eae2359a-ee78-4bdf-a146-e061dfb3ba66/British-Red-Cross-first-aid-app-being-tested-on-a-mobile-phone.jpg?w=1080\u0026h=608\u0026fit=clip\u0026rect=0,0,1084,610\",\"width\":1084,\"height\":610,\"renditions\":{\"default\":{\"rendition_id\":\"94648bfb-cdbe-4a70-8413-7c3179f9bb36\",\"preset_id\":\"a6d98cd5-8b2c-4e50-99c9-15192bce2490\",\"width\":1080,\"height\":608,\"query\":\"w=1080\u0026h=608\u0026fit=clip\u0026rect=0,0,1084,610\",\"url\":\"https://assets.redcross.org.uk/82b1e254-5524-0172-0612-9ce813c7824c/eae2359a-ee78-4bdf-a146-e061dfb3ba66/British-Red-Cross-first-aid-app-being-tested-on-a-mobile-phone.jpg?w=1080\u0026h=608\u0026fit=clip\u0026rect=0,0,1084,610\"}}}]},\"caption\":{\"name\":\"Caption\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"\"},\"credit\":{\"name\":\"Credit\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"\"}},\"system\":{\"codename\":\"general_first_aid_app_image\",\"collection\":\"main\",\"id\":\"3b8da4bd-b56b-493e-a1da-89edbc891ee7\",\"language\":\"en\",\"lastModified\":\"2025-10-14T10:39:38.5241015Z\",\"name\":\"General first aid app-Image\",\"sitemapLocations\":[],\"type\":\"image\",\"workflowStep\":\"published\",\"workflow\":\"default\"}}]},\"show_bottom_border\":{\"name\":\"Show bottom border\",\"type\":\"multiple_choice\",\"value\":[{\"name\":\"No\",\"codename\":\"false\"}]}},\"system\":{\"codename\":\"free_first_aid_apps_multi_col_layout_2\",\"collection\":\"main\",\"id\":\"8141d5ce-7596-4660-929e-e62b95f92767\",\"language\":\"en\",\"lastModified\":\"2025-10-16T14:00:33.7059693Z\",\"name\":\"free first aid apps-multi col layout 2\",\"sitemapLocations\":[],\"type\":\"_multi_column_layout\",\"workflowStep\":\"published\",\"workflow\":\"default\"}},{\"elements\":{\"column_1\":{\"name\":\"Column 1\",\"type\":\"modular_content\",\"value\":[\"baby_and_child_first_aid_app_rich_text_app_links\",\"baby_and_child_first_aid_app_quote_816d257\"],\"linkedItems\":[{\"elements\":{\"text\":{\"images\":[],\"linkedItemCodenames\":[],\"linkedItems\":[],\"links\":[],\"name\":\"Text\",\"type\":\"rich_text\",\"value\":\"\u003ch2\u003eBaby and child first aid app\u003c/h2\u003e\\n\u003cul\u003e\\n  \u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/baby-and-child-first-aid/id646471621?itsct=apps_box_badge\u0026amp;itscg=30200\\\"\u003eDownload the Baby and Child First Aid app from the Apple App Store\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\\n  \u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://play.google.com/store/search?q=baby+and+child+first+aid+app\u0026amp;c=apps\u0026amp;hl=en_GB\u0026amp;pcampaignid=pcampaignidMKT-Other-global-all-co-prtnr-py-PartBadge-Mar2515-1\\\"\u003eDownload the Baby and Child First Aid app from Google Play for Android\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\\n\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003c/ul\u003e\"}},\"system\":{\"codename\":\"baby_and_child_first_aid_app_rich_text_app_links\",\"collection\":\"main\",\"id\":\"1bbd5bc7-8fe7-4439-88b0-5c9c355f0535\",\"language\":\"en\",\"lastModified\":\"2025-10-16T14:00:01.491065Z\",\"name\":\"Baby and child first aid app-rich text-App links\",\"sitemapLocations\":[],\"type\":\"rich_text\",\"workflowStep\":\"published\",\"workflow\":\"default\"}},{\"elements\":{\"quote\":{\"images\":[],\"linkedItemCodenames\":[],\"linkedItems\":[],\"links\":[],\"name\":\"Quote\",\"type\":\"rich_text\",\"value\":\"\u003cp\u003eGreat reassurance if you have a baby or child. I like that you can test your knowledge. Good to top up on your knowledge every now and then.\u003c/p\u003e\"},\"attribution\":{\"name\":\"Attribution\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"User review from Leila\"}},\"system\":{\"codename\":\"baby_and_child_first_aid_app_quote_816d257\",\"collection\":\"main\",\"id\":\"816d257f-c705-4810-8d93-4b07b3753bb4\",\"language\":\"en\",\"lastModified\":\"2025-10-16T14:01:13.7417252Z\",\"name\":\"Baby and child first aid app-Quote\",\"sitemapLocations\":[],\"type\":\"quote\",\"workflowStep\":\"published\",\"workflow\":\"default\"}}]},\"column_2\":{\"name\":\"Column 2\",\"type\":\"modular_content\",\"value\":[\"baby_and_child_first_aid_app_mcl_rich_text_2\"],\"linkedItems\":[{\"elements\":{\"text\":{\"images\":[],\"linkedItemCodenames\":[],\"linkedItems\":[],\"links\":[],\"name\":\"Text\",\"type\":\"rich_text\",\"value\":\"\u003cp\u003eThe British Red Cross free baby and child first aid app helps you keep your little ones safe. The app provides child and baby first aid advice and is designed to support parents, grandparents, and caregivers to learn 17 first aid skills to help in a first aid emergency. You can also find tips on how to prepare for emergencies both at home and while out and about.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\u003ch3\u003eKey app features:\u003c/h3\u003e\\n\u003cul\u003e\\n  \u003cli\u003esimple step-by-step skill guides\u0026nbsp;\u003c/li\u003e\\n  \u003cli\u003evideos\u003c/li\u003e\\n  \u003cli\u003eanimations\u003c/li\u003e\\n  \u003cli\u003einteractive quizzes\u0026nbsp;\u003c/li\u003e\\n  \u003cli\u003etoolkit feature to record children's medical needs\u0026nbsp;\u003c/li\u003e\\n  \u003cli\u003euseful tips and signposting to further information\u0026nbsp;\u003c/li\u003e\\n  \u003cli\u003efirst aid course information\u0026nbsp;\u003c/li\u003e\\n\u003c/ul\u003e\"}},\"system\":{\"codename\":\"baby_and_child_first_aid_app_mcl_rich_text_2\",\"collection\":\"main\",\"id\":\"6e7d7dcc-9eee-4a46-b9e8-e1af61a5be84\",\"language\":\"en\",\"lastModified\":\"2025-10-14T13:44:33.2162952Z\",\"name\":\"Baby and child first aid app-MCL-Rich text 2\",\"sitemapLocations\":[],\"type\":\"rich_text\",\"workflowStep\":\"published\",\"workflow\":\"default\"}}]},\"show_bottom_border\":{\"name\":\"Show bottom border\",\"type\":\"multiple_choice\",\"value\":[{\"name\":\"No\",\"codename\":\"false\"}]}},\"system\":{\"codename\":\"baby_and_child_first_aid_app_multi_col_layout_3\",\"collection\":\"main\",\"id\":\"2ccb8b7e-978d-46ca-9c05-dcf0f53f99b2\",\"language\":\"en\",\"lastModified\":\"2025-10-16T14:00:47.3302649Z\",\"name\":\"Baby and child first aid app-Multi col layout 3\",\"sitemapLocations\":[],\"type\":\"_multi_column_layout\",\"workflowStep\":\"published\",\"workflow\":\"default\"}},{\"elements\":{\"title\":{\"name\":\"Title\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"\"},\"text\":{\"name\":\"Text\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"\"},\"cards\":{\"name\":\"Cards\",\"type\":\"modular_content\",\"value\":[\"gemma_s_story_card\"],\"linkedItems\":[{\"elements\":{\"title\":{\"name\":\"Title\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Gemma's story\"},\"text\":{\"name\":\"Text\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"When two-year-old Seven choked on a plastic toy brick, her mum Gemma remembered what she’d learned from a British Red Cross first aid video on Facebook and acted quickly.\"},\"link\":{\"name\":\"Link\",\"type\":\"modular_content\",\"value\":[\"gemma_s_story_card_link\"],\"linkedItems\":[{\"elements\":{\"display\":{\"name\":\"Display\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Read Gemma's story\"},\"external_link\":{\"name\":\"External Link\",\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"https://www.redcross.org.uk/stories/health-and-social-care/first-aid/the-day-i-saved-my-choking-2-year-old\"},\"internal_link\":{\"name\":\"Internal Link\",\"type\":\"modular_content\",\"value\":[],\"linkedItems\":[]}},\"system\":{\"codename\":\"gemma_s_story_card_link\",\"collection\":\"main\",\"id\":\"da324fdc-815c-4484-be97-bf20bdb49d66\",\"language\":\"en\",\"lastModified\":\"2025-10-14T13:47:04.2340476Z\",\"name\":\"Gemma's story card link\",\"sitemapLocations\":[],\"type\":\"link\",\"workflowStep\":\"published\",\"workflow\":\"default\"}}]},\"image\":{\"name\":\"Image\",\"type\":\"asset\",\"value\":[{\"name\":\"RS20982-Gemma-Percy-Dean.jpg\",\"description\":\"An image of Gemma holding her baby.\",\"type\":\"image/jpeg\",\"size\":3781797,\"url\":\"https://assets.redcross.org.uk/82b1e254-5524-0172-0612-9ce813c7824c/f7c8aa26-7899-4064-a574-2962859ab16b/RS20982-Gemma-Percy-Dean.jpg?w=735\u0026h=551\u0026fit=clip\u0026rect=457,0,7342,5504\",\"width\":8256,\"height\":5504,\"renditions\":{\"default\":{\"rendition_id\":\"8ecbb38e-f42f-4cfa-a487-8985751af19b\",\"preset_id\":\"a6d98cd5-8b2c-4e50-99c9-15192bce2490\",\"width\":735,\"height\":551,\"query\":\"w=735\u0026h=551\u0026fit=clip\u0026re